        "TileImage": "$($repository b7bd3e6d-8f37-4bac-ae4d-1f30f5ab4152).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rThe Scelestus task force has identified independent contractors responsible for the attack on the ICA. They are your targets and are currently employed by Kronstadt Industries, working in Miami in an official capacity as security but also as wetwork operatives for Kronstadt CFO Sierra Knox. As before, we cannot afford to make an enemy out of the Knox family, so the eliminations cannot be traced to us.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
